        "type": "function",
        "z": "7b7af74ecb758624",
        "g": "bef83c63ed1a9b12",
        "name": "Convert sysTime back (UTC timestamp)",
        "func": "//var sysTime = msg.payload.plcPackets[0].sysTime\nconst dt_new = new Date( )\nconst dt = dt_new.getTime()\n\n\nconst in_left = Math.round(dt/1000)\nconst nanos = BigInt(in_left) << 32n | BigInt(dt_new.getMilliseconds() * 1e6)\n\nconst nanos_c = Number(nanos)\n\nmsg.payload.plcPackets[0].sysTime = nanos_c\nreturn msg;",
